{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-management-leaks","title":"内存管理与泄漏检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/memory-management-leaks","wordCount":1146,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存管理与泄漏检测\">内存管理与泄漏检测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存是移动设备最稀缺的资源之一。iOS 没有传统的 swap 空间，系统内存压力大时会直接终止后台应用（Jetsam）；Android 虽有 Low Memory Killer，但频繁的 GC 停顿同样影响流畅度。内存泄漏会导致应用内存持续增长，最终触发 OOM（Out of Memory）崩溃或被系统强制回收。检测和治理内存泄漏是移动应用稳定性保障的基础工作。</p>\n<p>移动端内存分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内存类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型大小</th>\n<th>优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码段</td>\n<td>Mach-O / DEX 映射</td>\n<td>30-100MB</td>\n<td>代码瘦身、动态加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堆内存</td>\n<td>对象分配（malloc/new）</td>\n<td>50-300MB</td>\n<td>对象生命周期管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片缓存</td>\n<td>解码后 Bitmap</td>\n<td>50-200MB</td>\n<td>降采样、缓存淘汰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈内存</td>\n<td>线程栈空间</td>\n<td>每线程 512KB-1MB</td>\n<td>控制线程数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件映射</td>\n<td>mmap 映射区域</td>\n<td>变动大</td>\n<td>按需映射、及时释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"ios-内存管理机制\">iOS 内存管理机制</h3><p>iOS 使用 ARC（Automatic Reference Counting）管理堆内存。编译器在编译期自动插入 <code>retain</code>/<code>release</code> 调用，引用计数归零时立即释放对象。</p>\n<p><strong>常见内存泄漏模式</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[循环引用] --&gt; B[A 强引用 B&lt;br&gt;B 强引用 A]&#10;    C[Block 捕获] --&gt; D[self 被 Block 强引用&lt;br&gt;self 持有 Block]&#10;    E[Timer 泄漏] --&gt; F[NSTimer 强引用 target&lt;br&gt;RunLoop 持有 Timer]&#10;    G[通知未移除] --&gt; H[NotificationCenter&lt;br&gt;持有 observer]&#10;    I[delegate 强引用] --&gt; J[子对象 delegate&lt;br&gt;指向父对象用 strong]\">flowchart TD\n    A[循环引用] --&gt; B[A 强引用 B&lt;br&gt;B 强引用 A]\n    C[Block 捕获] --&gt; D[self 被 Block 强引用&lt;br&gt;self 持有 Block]\n    E[Timer 泄漏] --&gt; F[NSTimer 强引用 target&lt;br&gt;RunLoop 持有 Timer]\n    G[通知未移除] --&gt; H[NotificationCenter&lt;br&gt;持有 observer]\n    I[delegate 强引用] --&gt; J[子对象 delegate&lt;br&gt;指向父对象用 strong]</pre><p><strong>iOS 内存检测工具矩阵</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>检测类型</th>\n<th>自动化程度</th>\n<th>生产环境</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Xcode Memory Graph</td>\n<td>循环引用、实例存活</td>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instruments - Leaks</td>\n<td>循环引用</td>\n<td>实时扫描</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instruments - Allocations</td>\n<td>内存增长趋势</td>\n<td>录制分析</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLeaksFinder</td>\n<td>VC/View 泄漏</td>\n<td>自动检测</td>\n<td>Debug 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FBRetainCycleDetector</td>\n<td>循环引用路径</td>\n<td>自动检测</td>\n<td>Debug 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OOMDetector</td>\n<td>OOM 前内存分配</td>\n<td>后台运行</td>\n<td>生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>MLeaksFinder 原理</strong>：</p>\n<p>当 ViewController 执行 <code>dismissViewControllerAnimated:</code> 或从 NavigationController pop 时，MLeaksFinder 在 2 秒后检查该 VC 及其 View 树中的所有对象是否已释放。未释放的对象即为潜在泄漏：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 简化原理&#10;extension UIViewController {&#10;    func willDealloc() {&#10;        DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + 2.0) { [weak self] in&#10;            if self != nil {&#10;                // 2秒后仍存活 = 泄漏嫌疑&#10;                assertionFailure(&quot;Memory Leak: \\(type(of: self!))&quot;)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        // 递归检查子 View&#10;        view.willDealloc()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 简化原理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UIViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> willDealloc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DispatchQueue.main.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asyncAfter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">weak</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // 2秒后仍存活 = 泄漏嫌疑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                assertionFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Memory Leak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">))</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 递归检查子 View</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        view.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">willDealloc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-内存管理机制\">Android 内存管理机制</h3><p>Android 使用 ART（Android Runtime）的分代 GC 管理 Java/Kotlin 堆内存。GC 暂停虽然在 ART 上已显著缩短（并发 GC），但仍可能造成帧丢失。</p>\n<p><strong>Android 特有内存问题</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Activity 泄漏</strong>：最严重的泄漏类型。一个 Activity 泄漏意味着其 View 树、Drawable、Bitmap 全部无法释放，可达数十 MB。</li>\n<li><strong>Fragment 泄漏</strong>：Fragment 的 View 在 <code>onDestroyView</code> 后应释放，但 binding 引用未清理会导致泄漏。</li>\n<li><strong>匿名内部类持有外部引用</strong>：Handler、Runnable、Listener 等匿名类隐式持有外部 Activity 引用。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>LeakCanary 工作原理</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as Application&#10;    participant LC as LeakCanary&#10;    participant GC as GC Engine&#10;    participant Heap as Heap Dump&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;LC: Activity.onDestroy()&#10;    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 创建 WeakReference(activity)&#10;    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 等待 5 秒&#10;    LC-&gt;&gt;GC: Runtime.gc()&#10;    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 检查 WeakRef.get()&#10;    alt 已释放&#10;        LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 正常,无泄漏&#10;    else 仍存活&#10;        LC-&gt;&gt;Heap: Debug.dumpHprofData()&#10;        Heap-&gt;&gt;LC: 分析引用链 (Shark)&#10;        LC-&gt;&gt;App: 展示泄漏路径通知&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as Application\n    participant LC as LeakCanary\n    participant GC as GC Engine\n    participant Heap as Heap Dump\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;LC: Activity.onDestroy()\n    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 创建 WeakReference(activity)\n    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 等待 5 秒\n    LC-&gt;&gt;GC: Runtime.gc()\n    LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 检查 WeakRef.get()\n    alt 已释放\n        LC-&gt;&gt;LC: 正常,无泄漏\n    else 仍存活\n        LC-&gt;&gt;Heap: Debug.dumpHprofData()\n        Heap-&gt;&gt;LC: 分析引用链 (Shark)\n        LC-&gt;&gt;App: 展示泄漏路径通知\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"大图与-bitmap-内存治理\">大图与 Bitmap 内存治理</h3><p>图片是移动端内存的最大消耗来源。一张 1080x1920 的 ARGB_8888 图片解码后占用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1080</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1920</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8.29</mn><mtext> MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = W \\times H \\times B = 1080 \\times 1920 \\times 4 = 8.29 \\text{ MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1080</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1920</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.29</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> MB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为宽度像素、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为高度像素、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为每像素字节数。</p>\n<p><strong>大图防护策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降采样</td>\n<td>ImageIO / BitmapFactory.Options.inSampleSize</td>\n<td>内存 ÷ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式优化</td>\n<td>RGB_565 替代 ARGB_8888（无透明需求时）</td>\n<td>内存 ÷ 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存缓存淘汰</td>\n<td>LRU Cache + 内存水位监控</td>\n<td>峰值可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大图告警</td>\n<td>Hook ImageView.setImage 检测尺寸</td>\n<td>开发期防护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片加载</td>\n<td>BitmapRegionDecoder（超大图）</td>\n<td>按需加载可见区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"内存水位监控与-oom-防护\">内存水位监控与 OOM 防护</h3><p>线上环境无法使用 Instruments/LeakCanary，需要轻量级的内存监控方案：</p>\n<p><strong>iOS 内存水位监控</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func currentMemoryUsage() -&gt; UInt64 {&#10;    var info = mach_task_basic_info()&#10;    var count = mach_msg_type_number_t(MemoryLayout.size(ofValue: info) / MemoryLayout&lt;integer_t&gt;.size)&#10;    let result = withUnsafeMutablePointer(to: &amp;info) {&#10;        $0.withMemoryRebound(to: integer_t.self, capacity: Int(count)) {&#10;            task_info(mach_task_self_, task_flavor_t(MACH_TASK_BASIC_INFO), $0, &amp;count)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return result == KERN_SUCCESS ? info.resident_size : 0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currentMemoryUsage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UInt64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mach_task_basic_info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mach_msg_type_number_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MemoryLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ofValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: info) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MemoryLayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">integer_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withUnsafeMutablePointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withMemoryRebound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: integer_t.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            task_info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mach_task_self_, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_flavor_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(MACH_TASK_BASIC_INFO), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KERN_SUCCESS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> info.resident_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>OOM 阈值参考</strong>（iOS）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备</th>\n<th>物理内存</th>\n<th>前台 OOM 阈值（约）</th>\n<th>安全水位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iPhone 12</td>\n<td>4GB</td>\n<td>~2GB</td>\n<td>1.2GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iPhone SE (2nd)</td>\n<td>3GB</td>\n<td>~1.4GB</td>\n<td>800MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iPhone 8</td>\n<td>2GB</td>\n<td>~1GB</td>\n<td>600MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实践案例\">实践案例</h2><p>某直播 App 内存泄漏专项治理：</p>\n<p><strong>背景</strong>：线上 OOM 率持续升高，从 0.3% 涨至 0.8%，Crash 排名第一。</p>\n<p><strong>排查过程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>接入 OOMDetector，发现 OOM 前内存峰值集中在 1.8GB+</li>\n<li>分析内存分配 Top 10：直播间 View 层级占 400MB（异常）</li>\n<li>使用 MLeaksFinder 复现：进出直播间 3 次后发现 LiveRoomVC 未释放</li>\n<li>Xcode Memory Graph 分析引用链：<code>Timer → Block → self</code> 循环引用</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>修复措施</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>泄漏点</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>修复方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LiveRoomVC</td>\n<td>Timer Block 强捕获 self</td>\n<td>[weak self] + invalidate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChatView</td>\n<td>delegate 用 strong 修饰</td>\n<td>改为 weak</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GiftAnimator</td>\n<td>CADisplayLink target 引用</td>\n<td>使用 Proxy 弱引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlayerManager</td>\n<td>单例持有 VC 引用</td>\n<td>退出时置 nil</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>治理效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OOM 率从 0.8% 降至 0.15%</li>\n<li>进出直播间 10 次后内存增量从 400MB 降至 &lt; 5MB</li>\n<li>Crash 排名从第 1 位降至第 8 位</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>内存管理的核心是「分配有度、释放及时、监控到位」。iOS 端重点治理循环引用（Block、Timer、delegate）和大图内存，Android 端重点关注 Activity/Fragment 泄漏和 GC 压力。线上监控需要建立内存水位告警和 OOM 归因体系。开发期使用 MLeaksFinder/LeakCanary 实现自动化检测，将泄漏拦截在上线之前。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存管理与泄漏检测","id":"内存管理与泄漏检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 内存管理机制","id":"ios-内存管理机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 内存管理机制","id":"android-内存管理机制"},{"level":3,"text":"大图与 Bitmap 内存治理","id":"大图与-bitmap-内存治理"},{"level":3,"text":"内存水位监控与 OOM 防护","id":"内存水位监控与-oom-防护"},{"level":2,"text":"实践案例","id":"实践案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"列表滚动与复杂视图性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/rendering-performance/list-scrolling-performance"},"next":{"title":"功耗优化与后台任务管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/power-consumption-optimization"}}